      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Everyone should welcome this.\n\n\n0HOUR1 (@0hour1)\n\nUnited States to investigate American Influencers taking foreign money.\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/0hour1/status/2041855807210283425#m",
