    {
      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Every sentient voter should've known that Abigail Spanberger was never going to run Virginia like a moderate. You can find me and @Georgesantos wearing \"I Hate Abigail Spanberger\" t-shirts camped outside of the governor's mansion.\n\nWatch today's episode! piped.video/uTpTshOJd7I\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2041988831356830175",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-08T21:17:30+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Want to say this is a particularly weird experience for me specifically\u2026 \ud83d\ude06\ud83e\udd37\ud83c\udffc\u200d\u2640\ufe0f\n\n\nWilliam Wolfe \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8 (@WilliamWolfe)\n\nHow it feels to have kept your cool the last 48 hours because Trump is the same Trump he\u2019s been since he came down the golden escalator in 2015\n\nVideo\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/WilliamWolfe/status/2041659551443755299#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2041943180690522480",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-08T18:16:06+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "We're live! piped.video/live/uTpTshOJd7I\n\n\n\nMeghan McCain (@MeghanMcCain)\n\nToday on Citizen McCain: the diva returns!\n\n@Georgesantos is back with us at 12pm ET. We're getting into all things Iran &amp; the growing MAGA fracture over Trump's war strategy.\n\nJoin us live! \ud83c\udf35\ud83e\udde1 piped.video/uTpTshOJd7I\n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/MeghanMcCain/status/2041876858174607823#m",
